## Golden Signals Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Latency"
        A[Request Time<br/>p50: 150ms<br/>p95: 500ms<br/>p99: 1000ms]
    end

    subgraph "Traffic"
        B[Requests/sec<br/>Current: 1000<br/>Peak: 5000]
    end

    subgraph "Errors"
        C[Error Rate<br/>Current: 0.5%<br/>Threshold: 1%]
    end

    subgraph "Saturation"
        D[CPU: 75%]
        E[Memory: 80%]
        F[Disk: 60%]
    end

    G[Service] --> A
    G --> B
    G --> C
    G --> D
    G --> E
    G --> F

    A --> H[Alert if p99 > 1s]
    B --> I[Alert if > 10k RPS]
    C --> J[Alert if > 5%]
    D --> K[Alert if > 90%]
    E --> K
    F --> K
```

## Incident Management Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Monitoring
    participant AM as Alert Manager
    participant IM as Incident Manager
    participant IC as Incident Commander
    participant T as Team
    participant P as Postmortem

    M->>AM: Threshold Breach
    AM->>AM: Deduplicate & Enrich
    AM->>IM: Create Incident
    IM->>IM: Assign Severity
    IM->>IC: Notify Commander
    IC->>T: Assemble Team
    T->>T: Investigate
    T->>T: Implement Fix
    T->>IM: Mark Resolved
    IM->>P: Auto-create Postmortem
    P->>P: Document & Learn
```

## SLO Error Budget Flow

```mermaid
graph LR
    A[SLO: 99.9%] --> B[Error Budget: 0.1%]
    B --> C[~43 min/month]
    
    D[Current: 99.5%] --> E[Consumed: 0.5%]
    E --> F[5× Budget]
    
    F --> G{Burn Rate}
    G -->|High| H[Alert & Freeze]
    G -->|Normal| I[Continue]
    
    H --> J[Focus on Reliability]
    J --> K[Budget Replenishes]
    K --> I
```

## Self-Healing Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    A[Health Check] --> B{Healthy?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Continue]
    B -->|No| D[Detect Issue]
    
    D --> E[Find Strategy]
    E --> F{Strategy Found?}
    F -->|No| G[Alert Human]
    F -->|Yes| H[Check Cooldown]
    
    H --> I{In Cooldown?}
    I -->|Yes| G
    I -->|No| J[Execute Healing]
    
    J --> K{Success?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Update Health]
    K -->|No| M[Retry/ Escalate]
    
    L --> C
    M --> G
```

## Capacity Planning Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    A[Collect Metrics] --> B[Analyze Trends]
    B --> C[Forecast Growth]
    C --> D{Predicted > 80%?}
    
    D -->|Yes| E[Scale Up]
    D -->|No| F{Predicted < 30%?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Scale Down]
    F -->|No| H[Maintain]
    
    E --> I[Implement Changes]
    G --> I
    H --> J[Monitor]
    
    I --> J
    J --> A
```

## Disaster Recovery Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Primary Region"
        A[Primary DB]
        B[Primary Cache]
        C[Primary Queue]
        D[Primary Storage]
    end
    
    subgraph "Replication"
        E[Async Replication<br/>30s lag]
    end
    
    subgraph "Secondary Region"
        F[Secondary DB]
        G[Secondary Cache]
        H[Secondary Queue]
        I[Secondary Storage]
    end
    
    A --> E
    B --> E
    C --> E
    D --> E
    
    E --> F
    E --> G
    E --> H
    E --> I
    
    J[Health Check<br/>Every 30s] --> K{Failure?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Failover]
    K -->|No| M[Continue]
    
    L --> N[Promote Secondary]
    N --> O[Update DNS]
    O --> P[Scale Up]
    P --> Q[Validate]
```

## Chaos Engineering Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    A[Define Hypothesis] --> B[Pre-checks]
    B --> C{Pass?}
    C -->|No| D[Abort]
    C -->|Yes| E[Collect Metrics]
    
    E --> F[Inject Chaos]
    F --> G[Monitor System]
    G --> H{Stop Condition?}
    H -->|No| I[Continue]
    H -->|Yes| J[Stop Chaos]
    
    I --> G
    J --> K[Rollback]
    K --> L[Validate]
    L --> M{Success?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Document Learnings]
    M -->|No| O[Analyze & Improve]
    
    N --> P[Update Runbooks]
    O --> P
```

## Alert Routing Flow

```mermaid
graph TB
    A[Alert Triggered] --> B{Deduplicate}
    B -->|Duplicate| C[Suppress]
    B -->|New| D[Enrich Context]
    
    D --> E{Severity}
    E -->|SEV1| F[Page On-call]
    E -->|SEV2| G[Notify Team Lead]
    E -->|SEV3| H[Create Ticket]
    E -->|SEV4| I[Log Only]
    
    F --> J{Acknowledged?}
    G --> J
    H --> J
    
    J -->|No| K{Escalation Time?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Escalate]
    K -->|No| M[Wait]
    
    L --> N[Page Manager]
    M --> J
    
    J -->|Yes| O[Investigate]
    O --> P[Resolve]
    P --> Q[Postmortem]